{
  "__doc__": "Discord state for scripts/notify-discord.mjs. `forums` maps each state/province code to its forum channel: `name` is the channel the bot creates (once) when a local in that state first has job calls — needs discord.guild_id (+ optional discord.category_id for the “Job Calls” category) in job-calls.config.json + the bot’s Manage Channels permission — and `id` is filled in with the created channel’s id (or paste one to reuse an existing forum; job-calls.config.json → discord.forums still works as a fallback). Every other key is a local slug → { thread, comp, calls }: the bot keeps a forum thread per local, edits `comp` (the opening compensation card), posts new job calls below, and deletes a call’s message when it drops off the list. `calls` maps a job call id (js/data/job-calls.json) to its Discord message id. Delete a local row to make the bot recreate that thread.",
